   "html": "Park Boulevard",
   "plain": "Park Boulevard"
  },
  {
   "kind": "description",
   "html": "I developed the concept and oversaw production for a neighborhood mural that nods to quirky local history, researching stories, designing humorous ostrich characters, planning scale and installation with property owners, and specifying weather‑resistant materials and coatings; the tongue‑in‑cheek piece transformed the site into a photo‑worthy icon and local talking point.",
   "plain": "I developed the concept and oversaw production for a neighborhood mural that nods to quirky local history, researching stories, designing humorous ostrich characters, planning scale and installation with property owners, and specifying weather‑resistant materials and coatings; the tongue‑in‑cheek piece transformed the site into a photo‑worthy icon and local talking point."
  },
